1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,500
Captab: your cap table, from day zero to unicorn.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,100
Every issuance starts as a DAO proposal.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,200
Two of three board members approve, then the contract verifies and executes.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:12,600
One on-chain ledger tracks founders, the contributor pool and free capacity.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,300
Contributor grants vest monthly after a 12-month cliff.

6
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,800
Claims are sponsored, so a contributor holding 0 NEAR can still claim.

7
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,800
Payouts come from a frozen snapshot the DAO approved and funded exactly.

8
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:23,400
A failed payment returns to escrow, and the retry pays exactly once.

9
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:27,200
Live today: founders, grants, payouts. Next: investor rounds and share tokens.

10
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,800
Captab. From day zero to unicorn, governed on NEAR.
